#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:2 36cfa44384d84746a51fe20c9011b239
msgid "Extensions"
msgstr "扩展"

#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:4 5387bb394cbb4ea794f9c77210d47414
msgid ""
"Extensions are extra packages that add functionality to a Flask "
"application. For example, an extension might add support for sending "
"email or connecting to a database. Some extensions add entire new "
"frameworks to help build certain types of applications, like a REST API."
msgstr ""
"扩展是为 Flask 应用程序添加功能的额外包。 "
"例如，一个扩展可能用于添加发送电子邮件的支持，或用于连接数据库。 "
"有些扩展甚至提供了完整的新框架，用于构建特定类型的应用，例如 REST API。"

#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:11 8958ba59953e43738d0608deade1e904
msgid "Finding Extensions"
msgstr "查找扩展"

#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:13 03ad2c60b52a44d6b85382d983965b25
msgid ""
"Flask extensions are usually named \"Flask-Foo\" or \"Foo-Flask\". You "
"can search PyPI for packages tagged with `Framework :: Flask <pypi_>`_."
msgstr ""
"Flask 扩展通常被命名为 \"Flask-Foo\" 或 \"Foo-Flask\"。 你可以在 PyPI "
"上搜索带有 `Framework :: Flask <pypi_>`_ 标签的包来查找扩展。"

#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:18 f78592be7b1c4385a16a01b203daccac
msgid "Using Extensions"
msgstr "使用扩展"

#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:20 dd1c25a15c5148749704deac88a0ed74
msgid ""
"Consult each extension's documentation for installation, configuration, "
"and usage instructions. Generally, extensions pull their own "
"configuration from :attr:`app.config <flask.Flask.config>` and are passed"
" an application instance during initialization. For example, an extension"
" called \"Flask-Foo\" might be used like this::"
msgstr ""
"请查阅每个扩展的文档，以获取安装、配置和使用方法的说明。 通常，扩展会从 "
":attr:`app.config <flask.Flask.config>` 中读取配置项， 并在初始化时接收 "
"Flask 应用实例。例如，一个名为 \"Flask-Foo\" 的扩展，可能会这样使用::"

#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:40 9328db090acd4700a2c104bd670a73e5
msgid "Building Extensions"
msgstr "构建扩展"

#: ../../project/docs/extensions.rst:42 521583aa832e47fe9e6e5b76b55ce582
msgid ""
"While `PyPI <pypi_>`_ contains many Flask extensions, you may not find an"
" extension that fits your need. If this is the case, you can create your "
"own, and publish it for others to use as well. Read :doc:`extensiondev` "
"to develop your own Flask extension."
msgstr ""
"虽然 `PyPI <pypi_>`_ 上已经有许多 Flask 扩展， "
"但你可能找不到完全符合你需求的扩展。 "
"这种情况下，你可以创建自己的扩展，并将其发布供他人使用。 请阅读 "
":doc:`extensiondev` 文档，了解如何开发你自己的 Flask 扩展。"

